 r←RenderJsonToken match;parts;value
⍝ Called by ⎕R in `RenderConfigJson` for everything one of its patterns matches, which
⍝ `match.PatternNum` tells apart; see there for the patterns.
⍝ `parts` holds the whole match followed by its groups.
 parts←match.Lengths↑¨match.Offsets↓¨⊂match.Block
 :Select match.PatternNum
 :Case 0                                            ⍝ A key
     r←(2⊃parts),'<span class="json-key">',(3⊃parts),'</span>',4⊃parts
 :Case 1                                            ⍝ A URL
     value←1↓¯1↓match.Match
     r←'<span class="json-string">"<a href="',value,'" target="_blank" rel="noopener">',value,'</a>"</span>'
 :Case 2                                            ⍝ Any other string
     value←1↓¯1↓match.Match
     :If 0<≢'^\s*group\s*:'⎕S 0⊣match.Block
     :AndIf ⊃0 G.INI.Get'Config:GroupHomePages'
     :AndIf HasGroupHomePage value
         r←'<span class="json-string">"<a href="/',(GetVersion_REST'group-homepage?name='),value,'">',value,'</a>"</span>'
     :Else
         r←'<span class="json-string">',match.Match,'</span>'
     :EndIf
 :Case 3                                            ⍝ A number
     r←'<span class="json-number">',match.Match,'</span>'
 :EndSelect
